  (text "Reverse protection: AO3401A P-FET (body diode anode at input). With the gate pulled to GND, Vgs = -Vin; the AO3401A is rated +/-12 V, so a gate clamp is needed once Vin exceeds 12 V (running at 21 V)." (at 30 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 427c6f36-b979-40f7-ac69-69b8edad4bfa))
  (text "Bulk capacitance: size from breadboard rail-sag measurements. VIN_S = Vin x 18k/118k = 3.2 V at Vin = 21 V, to ADC A3 (scale 0.1525)." (at 30 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9ace543a-a2f1-46ed-b995-7599a71b1aac))
  (text "J1001: pin 1 VIN_RAW, pin 2 GND, pin 3 TX, pin 4 RX (Nano D1/TX, D0/RX). GND is shared with the power input; pins 2-4 form a GND / TX / RX UART header. Do not plug a UART cable onto pins 1-2." (at 30 38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8b7d3647-b5cf-4397-b2d1-c997d0152630))
